# Optional WSL2 tuning for ADTC-like profiling (copy to %USERPROFILE%\.wslconfig, then `wsl --shutdown`).
#
# Limits WSL to 4 logical CPUs — closer to the competition reference laptop and
# reduces hyper-thread contention that depresses llama-bench TPS on dev machines.
#
# [wsl2]
# memory=12GB
# processors=4
# swap=8GB
